# packages/: most entries are standalone git repos cloned by
# `airfield subprojects checkout` (never tracked here). The exceptions below
# are config-only packages (no source, no upstream repo) whose airfield
# config would otherwise live in no repository at all. `packages/*` (not
# `packages/`) so the negations can re-include them; the trailing !.air
# lines override the global .air ignore above for just these packages.
packages/*
!packages/vnc
!packages/rviz2
!packages/foxglove_bridge
packages/*/core
!packages/vnc/.air
!packages/rviz2/.air
!packages/foxglove_bridge/.air
